# Any line from the server counts as liveness. After 270 s of silence we
# PING; the answer, like any line, resets the clock. 360 s of silence closes
# the link. The server's own PING is answered by the transport, so we send
# nothing for it, but it still counts.
> CAP LS 302
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :irc.test 001 textual :Welcome
? registered textual
@ +200s
< :friend!u@h PRIVMSG textual :hi
? next-wake 270s
@ +100s
< PING :irc.test
? next-wake 270s
@ +269.999s
? next-wake 1ms
@ +1ms
> PING textual-gtk
? next-wake 90s
< :irc.test PONG irc.test :textual-gtk
? next-wake 270s
@ +270s
> PING textual-gtk
@ +89.999s
? registered textual
@ +1ms
> hangup #1
? notice Disconnected: no reply from the server; reconnecting in 5 s
? waiting 4.965s
